WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Goals and milestones. Workspace goals with target dates and milestones that roll up linked tasks' progress.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: quarterly okr; launch.

3
00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:12.210
Create a goal…

4
00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:15.180
…with a target date.

5
00:00:15.180 --> 00:00:20.340
Open it to add milestones and tasks.

6
00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:31.150
Add tasks straight onto the goal…

7
00:00:31.150 --> 00:00:35.070
…and progress fills in as they're done.

8
